WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,200
I'm sorry, Mr. Shen

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,060
I always remember

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,060
I'm just an old version of the number nine-two-six

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:15,030
I am nothing but Mr. Shen

5
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:18,030
I will definitely put five million points on that card.

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,030
please believe me

7
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,030
give me a little more time

8
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,030
your knees

9
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:24,030
Is it really that worthless?

10
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,030
Shen Xiujin

11
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,030
Do you know that I dare not cry in prison?

12
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:30,030
Every cry brings a beating

13
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,030
Do you know when you are thrown next to the toilet and sleep?

14
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,030
I thought I was not human

15
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:38,730
It's a dog, it's a pig. Get your head cut with dignity.

16
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,620
It’s no longer a haircut

17
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:46,340
Since Miss Jian said this herself,

18
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,340
It’s a shame that Mr. Shen failed to live up to Miss Jian’s wish.

19
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:54,600
Please ask Miss Jian to work hard in Donghuang from now on.

20
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,790
Thank you, Mr. Shen, yes
